@Payments.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5214

### Dashboard as of the end of the demo weekend (matches the golden figures)
GET {{Payments.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organisers/acct_demo/dashboard?asOf=2026-06-21T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Before po_0001 arrived: it shows as in transit
GET {{Payments.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organisers/acct_demo/dashboard?asOf=2026-06-17T12:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### No offset on asOf: 400 ProblemDetails
GET {{Payments.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organisers/acct_demo/dashboard?asOf=2026-06-21T00:00:00
Accept: application/json

### Unknown organiser: 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{Payments.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organisers/acct_other/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### Health
GET {{Payments.Api_HostAddress}}/health
